@startuml
title C4-уровень Code — Order Service (Event‑Driven, Go)

' === ДОМЕН (Domain) ===
class Order {
  - ID: uuid.UUID
  - CustomerID: uuid.UUID
  - Status: OrderStatus
  - Items: []OrderItem
  - TotalAmount: float64
  - ShippingAddress: string
  - CreatedAt: time.Time
  - UpdatedAt: time.Time
  + Apply(event Event): void
  + GetEvent(): Event
  + Replay(events []Event): void
}

enum OrderStatus {
  NEW
  PAID
  SHIPPED
  DELIVERED
  CANCELLED
}

class OrderItem {
  - ProductID: uuid.UUID
  - ProductName: string
  - Quantity: int
  - Price: float64
  - Total: float64
}

' === СОБЫТИЯ ===
class OrderCreated {
  + OrderID: uuid.UUID
  + CustomerID: uuid.UUID
  + Items: []OrderItem
  + TotalAmount: float64
  + Timestamp: time.Time
}

class OrderPaid {
  + OrderID: uuid.UUID
  + PaymentID: uuid.UUID
  + Timestamp: time.Time
}

class OrderCancelled {
  + OrderID: uuid.UUID
  + Reason: string
  + Timestamp: time.Time
}

' === ИНТЕРФЕЙСЫ (Ports) ===
interface OrderRepository {
  + Save(ctx context.Context, order *Order): error
  + FindByID(ctx context.Context, id uuid.UUID): (*Order, error)
  + FindAll(ctx context.Context, filter Filter): ([]*Order, error)
}

interface EventStore {
  + Save(aggregateID string, events ...Event): error
  + Load(aggregateID string): ([]Event, error)
}

interface EventPublisher {
  + Publish(ctx context.Context, event Event): error
}

interface EventConsumer {
  + Subscribe(topic string, handler func(Event) error): error
}

' === USE CASES ===
class CreateOrderUseCase {
  - repo: OrderRepository
  - eventStore: EventStore
  - eventPublisher: EventPublisher
  + Execute(ctx context.Context, cmd CreateOrderCommand): (*Order, error)
}

class CancelOrderUseCase {
  - repo: OrderRepository
  - eventStore: EventStore
  - eventPublisher: EventPublisher
  + Execute(ctx context.Context, cmd CancelOrderCommand): error
}

class OrderEventHandler {
  - repo: OrderRepository
  - eventStore: EventStore
  - eventPublisher: EventPublisher
  + HandlePaymentCompleted(event PaymentCompleted): error
  + HandleInventoryReserved(event InventoryReserved): error
}

' === АДАПТЕРЫ ===
class PostgresOrderRepository {
  - db: *sql.DB
  + Save(ctx context.Context, order *Order): error
  + FindByID(ctx context.Context, id uuid.UUID): (*Order, error)
  + FindAll(ctx context.Context, filter Filter): ([]*Order, error)
}

class PostgresEventStore {
  - db: *sql.DB
  + Save(aggregateID string, events ...Event): error
  + Load(aggregateID string): ([]Event, error)
}

class KafkaEventPublisher {
  - producer: sarama.SyncProducer
  + Publish(ctx context.Context, event Event): error
}

class KafkaEventConsumer {
  - consumer: sarama.ConsumerGroup
  + Subscribe(topic string, handler func(Event) error): error
}

' === ЗАВИСИМОСТИ ===
Order "1" *-- "0..*" OrderItem : contains
Order "1" -- "1..*" Event : generates

OrderRepository <|.. PostgresOrderRepository : implements
EventStore <|.. PostgresEventStore : implements
EventPublisher <|.. KafkaEventPublisher : implements
EventConsumer <|.. KafkaEventConsumer : implements

CreateOrderUseCase --> OrderRepository : uses
CreateOrderUseCase --> EventStore : uses
CreateOrderUseCase --> EventPublisher : uses

OrderEventHandler --> OrderRepository : uses
OrderEventHandler --> EventStore : uses
OrderEventHandler --> EventPublisher : uses

OrderEventHandler --> EventConsumer : subscribes

' === ПОЯСНЕНИЯ ===
note bottom of Order
  Агрегат Order:
  - Восстанавливается из событий (Event Sourcing)
  - Метод Apply(event) изменяет состояние
  - Метод GetEvent() возвращает новое событие
  - Метод Replay(events) восстанавливает всю историю
end note

note bottom of OrderEventHandler
  Обработчики событий:
  - HandlePaymentCompleted: обновляет статус заказа на PAID
  - HandleInventoryReserved: подтверждает резервирование
  - HandlePaymentFailed: запускает компенсацию (OrderCancelled)
  - HandleOrderCancelled: компенсация (отмена платежа, освобождение товаров)
end note

note bottom of KafkaEventConsumer
  Подписки:
  - topic: payments (PaymentCompleted, PaymentFailed)
  - topic: inventory (InventoryReserved, InventoryReleased)
  - topic: orders (OrderCancelled)
end note

@enduml